-One, two, three.

1385
01:15:40.619 --> 01:15:41.453
All right, that's it.

1386
01:15:41.537 --> 01:15:43.372
-One, two, three!
-One, two, three!

1387
01:15:44.665 --> 01:15:46.416
-One, two, three.
-One, two, three.

1388
01:15:46.500 --> 01:15:47.709
-Hold on.
-Wait.

1389
01:15:48.210 --> 01:15:49.711
-Hold on.
-Wait.

1390
01:15:50.963 --> 01:15:52.172
Come on, fail.

1391
01:15:52.923 --> 01:15:53.924
Come on, fail.

1392
01:15:54.424 --> 01:15:56.343
-Hold on.
-Wait.

1393
