1439
01:17:43.784 --> 01:17:44.618
All right.

1440
01:17:44.701 --> 01:17:46.119
Brace your leg, Min-jae. Come on.

1441
01:17:46.203 --> 01:17:47.496
Min-jae, brace your leg.

