-Yeah.

1453
01:18:10.644 --> 01:18:12.437
-One, two, three!
-One, two, three!

1454
01:18:14.106 --> 01:18:16.358
-One, two, three! Okay.
-One, two, three!

1455
01:18:16.858 --> 01:18:17.734
-Three!
-Three!

1456
01:18:18.443 --> 01:18:20.362
-We've got to put in the power.
-Let's put in the power.

1457
01:18:21.154 --> 01:18:22.656
Min-jae, dig your legs in.

1458
01:18:22.739 --> 01:18:23.949
Dig your legs in.

1459
01:18:25.283 --> 01:18:26.493
You need to stay in this stance.

1460
01:18:26.576 --> 01:18:27.619
