1470
01:18:53.562 --> 01:18:55.397
-One, two, three!
-One, two, three!

1471
01:19:00.402 --> 01:19:01.236
Yes!

1472
01:19:01.903 --> 01:19:02.738
Yes!

1473
01:19:04.156 --> 01:19:05.031
