1479
01:19:21.465 --> 01:19:23.759
-It's harder than I thought it would be.
-Yeah.

1480
01:19:24.259 --> 01:19:25.969
We thought we'd win by a landslide,

1481
01:19:26.052 --> 01:19:27.304
