pretty evenly matched in strength too.

1485
01:19:42.527 --> 01:19:45.530
With such a slim margin,
we couldn't let them get ahead.

1486
01:19:45.614 --> 01:19:49.993
We were pretty evenly matched
with Team Korea,

1487
01:19:50.076 --> 01:19:52.287
so it felt like we were on a knife's edge.

1488
01:19:52.788 --> 01:19:54.539
Is it down to
which team hits it first now?

1489
01:19:54.623 --> 01:19:55.832
Yeah, whoever hits it first wins.

1490
01:19:55.916 --> 01:19:59.878
Both our record was 35 seconds,
so it could come down to a single second.

1491
01:19:59.961 --> 01:20:00.962
-Right.
-Yeah.

1492
01:20:01.046 --> 01:20:04.257
We've got to run to the finish point
as fast as we can.

1493
01:20:04.841 --> 01:20:06.510
We've got to save time at the start.

1494
01:20:06.593 --> 01:20:09.721
